# NestJS structure

## Layers

| Layer | Role |
| --- | --- |
| controller | HTTP transport, DTO binding |
| service | Use-case orchestration |
| domain | Business invariants (when separated) |
| dto (`@repo/api`) | Contract shape |
| prisma | Persistence only in `packages/database` |

- No Prisma in controllers.
- No raw Prisma models in HTTP responses — map to `@repo/api`.
- Multi-step DB → transaction in service.
- Module-per-domain; no cross-import internal files.

